    "body": "## Owner Safari acceptance reported - local Chat03 two-player harness\n\n**Owner message (2026-10-28, Asia/Tokyo):** «пасс, ебош дальше» in direct response to the requested final-head two-window Safari test of Draft PR #449. Record as **OWNER_REPORTED_SAFARI_PASS**, not an independently reproduced browser test. Scope of prior requested smoke was A/B local views, DRAW, win/loss, and reconnect; no per-case screenshots, logs or separate timings were supplied. Do not manufacture additional evidence.\n\n**Exact checkpoint:** PR #449 HEAD `de6a6130622097d7123b3f4d6ce2da18bea1d9d3`, base `main@31b7a077820914e92de81239e5ab4099e3dfa558`; 8/8 GitHub check runs success; Codex-reported exact-head independent review PASS. Harness remains a **local synthetic two-browser test**, not real two-device/hosted/public/private-alpha authenticated acceptance.\n\n**Routing:** Local PR #449 may progress to reviewed, owner-controlled merge; do not merge automatically. The NEXT Chat03 task belongs in a **NEW Codex thread**, separate isolated branch/scope, because it concerns private owner + Керил real two-device policy and transport. Read the already merged `gameplay-server/PRIVATE_ALPHA_GATE.md` (PR #448) and PA-01..09 before proposing anything: do NOT re-create that policy plan or silently approve OPEN decisions.\n\n**Hard safety:** no hosted gameplay Worker/D1, no Cloudflare mutations, no use of telemetry D1, no staging deployment, no real invite, no Stage7.15 wiring, and no main write without separate owner permissions. Report exact head and context separately.",
